{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a9ccf72216d94ef65e405cb08e4051a92dd08e9865cdb3d39e15301bc6f90c7", "ja": "（この前演じた船の船長役が評判になり、\n真に仕事のオファーが次々と舞い込み始めている！）", "zh": "（之前饰演的船长大获好评，\n开始有一个又一个的工作邀约指定要真了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c047931df41c48927e0e9e2ef439ce482af255b799295856bac193b864502197", "ja": "おはよう真！　お、次に出る学園ドラマに向けて、\nさっそくレッスンを始めたのか？　さすがだな。", "zh": "真，早啊！哦，你已经在练习下次要拍的\n校园电视剧吗？真是精神可嘉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "f2fa81e23ff7e8568bb0f00af1c9453db773d8354c6579b07e57432484033d7e", "ja": "おはようございます{$P$}！　はい、\n台本読んだんですけど、もう体がうずうずしちゃって。", "zh": "{$P$}，早安！\n嗯，在下看完剧本以后，身体已经跃跃欲试了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "3030ecfad13eb77fd5ebb04052cc55a3e918832e38b9777938d7086596b1ccbb", "ja": "あ、でもそのことで、実は相談があるんです。ボク、\n今回は珍しく女の子役を貰えたわけですけど……。", "zh": "啊，但在下其实想跟你商量一下这件事。\n虽然在下这次难得拿到女生的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "75d584271bce75baaa35fe2ec85b7ed06b8a99ca10304b570878106dc7dada7a", "ja": "このオファーの返事って、\nもう、とっくにしちゃっていますよね……？", "zh": "这份工作邀约，\n已经给对方答复了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4602c8fb9afa300c0cbe7e0ae253486fff25e284c51e8bfb16798bae05b12cc9", "ja": "ああ、先方も熱心だったし、真も喜んでたしな。\n……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "是啊，对方相当热情，我看真也很高兴的样子。\n……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "202453eab0effcdac5c18077bd6e5241dcf0b9b1166a1ff21d34f52c8dd71a4c", "ja": "あの、もし今からでも間に合うなら、この……", "zh": "那个，如果还来得及，可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "71688bf165847bc2b9dddac04ec6472bd986e2458136b75fbfc48675945940e9", "ja": "ボート部の男の子っぽい女の子役にも、\n挑戦させてもらえませんか！？", "zh": "让在下也试试看划船社那个有点中性的女生吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0e81af78018aaf9a04d0f13b9ac7d867c080991f492a2d84cf3be607247f07a5", "ja": "ええっ！？　でも、今の華道部の部長役、\n真はすごく喜んでたじゃないか。なのに、どうして？", "zh": "咦咦！？可是真，你不是很喜欢现在这个\n花道社社长的角色吗？怎么会改变心意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "d15deabd97223e530095f7c750c317caedfc4293f42f94942a5a63701f43b2e8", "ja": "この台本を読んでるうちに、どうしても、どっち\nにもチャレンジしてみたくなったっていうか……。", "zh": "在下在读剧本的途中，\n开始觉得无论如何两边都想试试看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "777ec46beb517063ca4765b68f9ba315ae22564caefa38994807a60f8fe4284f", "ja": "この前、船の船長をやった時、大海原をみんなと冒険し\nたり、たくさんの島で色々な体験したじゃないですか？", "zh": "之前演船长的时候，在下不是和大家一起在海上闯荡，\n到许多岛屿体验了各式各样的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "a4b64b8db1086eb704108833c84827e26785fd8203fdd6b338e691141bfabf37", "ja": "あれからボク、……もっと自由に\n自分を試してみたくなったんです。", "zh": "在下自那之后……\n就变得想放开自己，让自己去尝试更多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "0984429c273d4190bda87b3d3224e862897b26a4a9b8a03fca14719031635789", "ja": "自分がしたい事も、できる事も、両方とも。わがまま\nだとは思うんですけど、でも、相談だけでもって！", "zh": "不管是自己想做，还是做得到的，在下都不想错过。\n在下知道这样很任性，但还是想跟你商量一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1013_p", "source_sha256": "36ea2d4bb15793361ef2cd3b4833b63b989158d39965660160f08d2ed2f9ce82", "ja": "な、なるほど、二役か……。何もそこまで試さなくても\nいい気がするけど、チャレンジ精神には感心したよ。", "zh": "原、原来如此，两个角色啊……虽然我觉得\n你不用做到这份上，但我很佩服你的挑战精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1014_p", "source_sha256": "803acb44bc1f364293a02d34ab00c9cf305a4264ead9d43c0c6f5e22af110af8", "ja": "真がそういうなら掛け合ってみるけど、もし実現したら\nレッスンも2倍になる。それでも大丈夫か？", "zh": "既然真都这么说了，我会去交涉看看。如果交涉成功，\n到时候的练习量也会翻倍，这样你确定还要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "13b38643ac14b3dc53d73952b31302a8ac39778ddbac44e3080488aef9e11c94", "ja": "はい、もちろん覚悟できてます！", "zh": "嗯，在下当然明白！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1016_p", "source_sha256": "abe8612e5305e415643d45cdb9833008472a10a718020954dabadf2dd3680bb8", "ja": "いい返事だ。さて、俺もスケジュールを調整しないと\nいけないけど……ま、何とかなるかな。", "zh": "很棒的回答。那么，我也该去调整行程了……\n反正应该是没问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "545931bed0ef998015a0e04dff8171775d423e86e89cdbf9cbfe70b2b79a321c", "ja": "え？　もしかして{$P$}、レッスンが\n2倍になっても、付き合ってくれるんですか？", "zh": "咦？难道练习量翻倍以后，\n{$P$}也会陪着在下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1018_p", "source_sha256": "23d80d845908c15a6fde8cba547dd73d4d1673a6de41508ebf8a29d80d8f7531", "ja": "もちろん。なんたって、俺も真の船の一員だからな。\n船長にはついて行くさ。", "zh": "这还用说，毕竟我也是真的船员啊。\n当然会跟着船长走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "993e0ddee269f34d47ace40ee6782eecdf9f161444dba6da77fea1eb8457c6f8", "ja": "わぁ……ありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇……谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "a9df30a4c807e23e9a0a095d404dd07e8701f2c1087474e6cf036cc3eff10561", "ja": "へへっ、{$P$}が乗ってるなら、\nボクの船は絶対無敵ですね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，船上有{$P$}在，\n那在下的船就所向无敌了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0073_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "6d3779faeaad37e74132ba5a748af76bcf1ef807bd9d2169776aa9a7e25dde1c", "ja": "どんな荒波も困難も乗りこえて、一緒にアイドル界の\n宝島を目指しましょう！　ようそろー！", "zh": "跨过无数的风浪和困境，一起前往偶像界的宝岛吧！\n全速前进──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
